    {
      "title_cn": "从芯片到技能：英伟达与韩国扩大主权AI合作",
      "title_en": "From Chips to Skills, NVIDIA and Korea Expand Sovereign AI Collaboration",
      "title_original": "From Chips to Skills, NVIDIA and Korea Expand Sovereign AI Collaboration",
      "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-11-09T05:00:04+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/korea-sovereign-ai-collaboration/",
      "category": "chips",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "英伟达与韩国科学技术信息通信部扩大主权AI生态合作，涵盖AI半导体、数据中心基础设施、人才、初创企业、模型、智能体与安全；为韩国NPU与XPU企业探索参与NVLink Fusion生态奠定基础，并提供培训认证、黑客松和技术研讨；英伟达将与三个入选联合体及四家韩国基础模型开发商使用NVIDIA Dynamo合作，并宣布在MSIT支持下与SK电讯、Rebellions合作。",
      "what_happened_en": "NVIDIA and Korea's MSIT are expanding collaboration across AI semiconductors, data center infrastructure, talent, startups, models, agents and security, laying groundwork for Korean NPU and XPU companies to explore the NVLink Fusion ecosystem, with training, certification, hackathons and seminars; NVIDIA will work with three selected consortia and four Korean foundation model builders using NVIDIA Dynamo, and announced work with SK Telecom and Rebellions supported by MSIT.",
      "why_it_matters": "该合作把芯片生态参与、技能培训与面向韩国模型和负载的推理优化结合起来。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The collaboration links chip-level ecosystem access with skills training and inference optimization for Korean models and workloads.",
