      "title_cn": "英伟达在CoRL发布开放机器人仿真工具",
      "title_en": "NVIDIA Unveils Open Robotics Simulation Tools at CoRL",
      "title_original": "Practice Makes Precise: At CoRL, NVIDIA and Partners Reveal How Robots Rehearse Delicate Work in Simulation",
      "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-11-09T14:00:01+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/robotics-simulation-advancements-corl/",
      "category": "robotics",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "在得克萨斯州奥斯汀举行的CoRL上，英伟达发布了世界动作模型、仿真工具、基准和智能体工作流等开放机器人技术；其GRAIL和RoboTTT两篇论文入围六个最佳论文候选。",
      "what_happened_en": "At CoRL in Austin, Texas, NVIDIA introduced open robotics technologies including world action models, simulation tools, benchmarks and agentic workflows; two NVIDIA papers, GRAIL and RoboTTT, are among six Best Paper finalists.",
      "why_it_matters": "英伟达称，仿真正从机器人行走转向对齐齿轮、连接线缆等精细操作任务。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "NVIDIA says simulation is moving from robot locomotion to delicate manipulation tasks such as aligning gears and connecting cables.",
